# stackguardian_workflow_template_revision (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Revisions

Each revision is a version of its parent
[`stackguardian_workflow_template`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/StackGuardian/stackguardian/latest/docs/resources/workflow_template), referenced by `template_id`. Create a new
revision to change what workflows inherit, rather than editing an existing one.

- `is_public` publishes the revision, making it available to reference from
  [`stackguardian_workflow_from_template`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/StackGuardian/stackguardian/latest/docs/resources/workflow_from_template).
- `deprecation` steers users off an old revision; `deprecation.message` should name the
  replacement.

## What workflows inherit

Every attribute set here becomes the default for workflows created from this revision. A workflow
that declares the same attribute overrides it; one that omits it inherits whatever this revision
sets — including after a revision upgrade.

